    "pros": [
      "Spec sheet lists UL ER7260-01 approval and ASTM C578 compliance",
      "Puncture-resistant white facer",
      "Clear per-inch R-value data at two temperatures",
      "About 60 sq ft per kit, sized for a typical 9 ft door"
    ],
    "cons": [
      "No published total R-value per panel (our estimate is about R-5)",
      "Rated for 1-1/4 inch thickness only",
      "Combustible foam; read the fire warning"
    ],
    "bottomLine": "If you want a foam kit with documentation you can show an inspector, Cellofoam's spec sheet is the most complete we found."
  },
  {
